WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.320
Apple must produce 3,200 documents a judge sampled from 122,000, epic says it hid. This is MAG 7 Daily, episode 66.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:17.400
A play store identity rule, a Dutch bid against meta's glasses, a US shipment count, and then cash, land, and the partner bill.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:26.380
A federal judge told Apple to hand epic games a random sample so epic can review papers it says were held back from the fight over proposed App Store commissions.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.080
9-5 Mac reported the order.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.720
It is a sample for that review, not a decision on the commissions.

00:00:33.717 --> 00:00:37.977
Google is changing who has to show a face or at least an address on the Play Store.

00:00:38.637 --> 00:00:43.057
The Verge reported that from next year, many independent Android developers must publish

00:00:43.057 --> 00:00:44.537
a phone number and an address.

00:00:45.037 --> 00:00:49.797
A step Google set is meant to meet the European Union's Digital Services Act, with those

00:00:49.797 --> 00:00:53.317
contact details made public worldwide rather than only in Europe.

00:00:53.317 --> 00:00:57.817
independent developers have already raised privacy worries about that worldwide

00:00:57.817 --> 00:01:03.270
disclosure. Dutch groups have asked a court to halt sales of Meta's AI glasses on

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:07.970
privacy grounds. The Business of Fashion reported the request and Biggo Finance

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:12.110
reported that the court is to rule on a bid to ban the glasses over the risk of

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:17.350
secret recording. No ban is in place on what those reports carry today. US

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:21.930
smartphone shipments fell 9% year over year in the third quarter. Counterpoint

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:27.230
research reported through tech meme as memory costs hit Android phone makers, especially at the

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:36.478
low end. Apple share rose from 50% to 57%. Samsung share held at 25%. Schneider Electric announced a

00:01:36.478 --> 00:01:43.538
tie between its open software defined automation and Amazon web services, introduced at SPS 2026 in

00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:50.378
Nuremberg. ARC Advisory Group reported. Through EcoStruxure Automation Expert, the control software is

00:01:50.378 --> 00:01:55.598
decoupled from the hardware, so engineers can reuse applications across compatible computers.

00:01:56.198 --> 00:02:01.418
Local function blocks connect to AI apps built with Amazon Bedrock and Amazon SageMaker,

00:02:02.018 --> 00:02:06.238
and AWS IoT greengrass deploys and manages them across plants.

00:02:06.878 --> 00:02:12.138
The point is fewer gateways, protocol converters, and custom interfaces, while time critical

00:02:12.138 --> 00:02:13.418
control stays local.

00:02:14.038 --> 00:02:18.798
Schneider named predictive maintenance, energy management, and operational optimization as

00:02:18.798 --> 00:02:24.418
uses, and the step follows its work with HPE and EcoStruxure Foxboro software defined

00:02:24.418 --> 00:02:25.098
automation.

00:02:25.758 --> 00:02:30.238
MarketScale reported the same push to cut the gateways between plant control and AI.

00:02:31.354 --> 00:02:35.914
As of November 25th, the open question was key man risk around Jensen Hoang.

00:02:36.694 --> 00:02:40.394
Bloomberg now reports that Nvidia reinstated him as chief executive.

00:02:40.914 --> 00:02:45.274
The Financial Times reported that a letter from Hoang was dropped from the company's ethics

00:02:45.274 --> 00:02:50.194
messaging, and that employees, analysts, and legal experts are asking whether the management

00:02:50.194 --> 00:02:52.554
structure and the governance will be reformed.

00:02:53.054 --> 00:02:58.154
That document order does not find that Apple's proposed commissions were papered over improperly,

00:02:58.574 --> 00:03:00.574
and it does not require the rest of the file.

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:06.014
Whether the sample shows what Epic alleges is still the open question, nothing reported

00:03:06.014 --> 00:03:07.634
today is a ruling on the merits.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:15.100
Foreign investors sold a record net $33.1 billion of Taiwanese stocks in November, topping

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:20.860
October's record outflow, with AI valuation fears and a broader tech sell-off as the backdrop

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:26.380
Bloomberg reported through tech meme. Vertical data centers are being proposed where land is scarce,

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:32.940
including in Taiwan, and Kansas City recently rejected a 20-story tower. The New York Times reported

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:38.500
through the same outlet. Neither item names a tenant or a seller among these companies. They name

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:43.980
the market and the permit around the buildings the build needs. Meta's cash is the company version of

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:44.620
that squeeze.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.420
CalCine Media reported that capital spending,

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.780
mostly for AI data centers and servers,

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.920
exceeded cash from operations

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.800
and pushed free cash flow negative

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.520
for the first time in many years.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:58.840
Meta raised the low end of its full-year capital spending

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.120
forecast and pause share repurchases.

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.140
The board approved a new class

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:05.520
of publicly listed non-voting shares,

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.360
effective early next year,

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:09.380
which the company said may be used

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.600
for capital raising, employee compensation,

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:12.820
and acquisitions.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:18.320
Calcine said some investors see that class as a way to fund the AI spend without diluting

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.120
voting control.

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:24.280
A large legal charge tied to a settlement with state attorney's general over youth mental

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:28.620
health and social media litigation, pulled reported operating income down.

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:32.220
Average price per ad and ad impressions both rose.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:35.500
Daily users across the family of apps kept growing.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:39.780
Metta launched Muse and Muse Wander as its first frontier models.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:45.660
4th quarter revenue was guided roughly in line with expectations. Reality labs losses

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:50.660
are expected to decline compared with last year. Management said it plans to keep investing

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:54.940
aggressively next year. Headcount declined meaningfully from a year earlier.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:05:00.320
Meta also disclosed very large future spending commitments tied to data centers and computing

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:07.740
capacity. Separate from that bill, iAfrica reported a $700,000 AI grant and a learning hub covering

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:13.700
for African countries. Amazon is on the selling side of the same build. Clickhouse expanded

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:20.300
its AWS strategic collaboration with an agreement of $1.5 billion plus to scale a unified

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:27.000
enterprise AI data stack. AI Insider reported. Westcon ComStore broke a $100 million

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:33.720
AWS marketplace barrier while chasing a one-stop shop role. IT Channel Oxygen reported.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:39.960
Alphabet's Waymo, in a smaller physical incident, said Agitax took seven cars out of service

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:44.800
after a Denver man allegedly blocked them with cones, the Times of India reported.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.340
What they share is not a joint contract.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:52.720
Meta is spending ahead of operating cash and has a non-voting class it says can raise money,

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.100
pay people or fund acquisitions.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:59.980
Amazon is where a data stack vendor and a distributor are putting enterprise commitments.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:03.040
The Taiwan selling is not pinned on either firm.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:08.500
It is a record exit from the market under the hardware story, framed as valuation fear.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:11.760
It shows a city can turn down a tall computer building.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:16.860
Waymo's sideline cars are a fleet taken offline by a person, not a spending line.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.060
The next check splits by company.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:24.360
Meta can try to fund the build without giving up votes if it uses the new class as described.

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:29.340
While the legal charge already cut reported operating income and buybacks are paused.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:35.140
Amazon's partner deals turn enterprise AI demand into contracted marketplace and collaboration

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:37.900
volume, rather than an uncommitted plan.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:42.000
The African grant and hub do not stand in for the data center commitments.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.800
They are a separate, far smaller program.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.980
The robotaxi incident does not change either bill.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:52.740
It shows cars already in service can come off the road without a regulatory order.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:58.080
The next dated step, a source names, is that non-voting share class, effective early

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:04.988
next year. Elsewhere, Microsoft is deprecating the telnet client in Windows, PC Gamer reported.

00:07:05.548 --> 00:07:11.488
Copilot Vision, which lets a user talk to the AI by sharing a screen, is now generally available.

00:07:11.828 --> 00:07:17.108
Biggo Finance reported. A Windows boss said there is no Windows 12 yet because Microsoft

00:07:17.108 --> 00:07:23.668
must prove its AI is useful and earn permission. After users pushed back on Copilot in Windows 11,

00:07:23.668 --> 00:07:30.168
Windows Latest reported. AWS added virtual iPhones to its cloud, the register reported.

00:07:30.948 --> 00:07:37.568
Gruppament Muscatairs is tapping Anthropic and AWS for an AI rollout, ESM magazine reported.

00:07:38.328 --> 00:07:45.068
Westcon Comstore became an authorized AWS distributor for Sub-Saharan Africa, Telecom Paper reported.

00:07:45.688 --> 00:07:51.268
That's Mag 7 Daily for today. Nothing in this show is financial advice. I'm Patrick in Vancouver,

00:07:51.268 --> 00:07:58.208
See you tomorrow, and if you'd rather watch than listen, find us on YouTube at Narin Network, links in the show notes.

